        <p class="ins-tag">Insight One · Fr. Verbist's Last Letter</p>
        <h3 class="ins-title">The Urgency of Now</h3>
        <p class="ins-body">
          <em>"Europe is really sick, but China hasn't healed. What will happen to the world? Let's hurry to accumulate some merits, since the end of life could be near."</em> In an era of pandemics and injustice, his urgency feels strangely contemporary. It taught me that I cannot afford to postpone my missionary commitment until retirement or "someday."
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="ins-node"><div class="ins-dot"></div></div>
