        <h3 class="ins-title">Heroism Is Fidelity</h3>
        <p class="ins-body">
          Choosing to stay with his Christians during the Boxer Rebellion, knowing it meant certain torture and death, yet calling it a <em>"sacrifice gladly offered"</em> - this redefined courage for me. Heroism isn't dramatic; it's fidelity to those you love when it costs everything.
        </p>
