        <p class="ins-body">
          A foreign nun gradually earning trust by bringing pillows and hot tea to suspicious Bontoc women - <em>this is my blueprint for authentic mission</em>. Grand rhetoric is cheap. Patient presence, practical care, and genuine respect are what build the beloved community. I will return to this image throughout my professional life.
        </p>
      </div>
